# Cloudflare Pages rewrites.
#
# report_url minted by the Worker is <site>/report?id=<id> — it goes into the
# CRM, the follow-up email and Maya's call context, so it must resolve. Pages
# serves /report.html for /report by default; this makes that explicit and
# survives a future change to that default. 200 = rewrite, query string kept.
/report  /report.html  200
